WEBVTT

00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:04.080
Ichigo?

00:00:13.060 --> 00:00:14.490
Ichigo.

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:17.000
Why?

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.460
No one has noticed it’s me neither on TV or at school.

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:24.500
Has Aoyama-kun discovered the truth?

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.840
I’m a Mew Mew!

00:00:29.640 --> 00:00:30.770
Wait!

00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:48.690
Thank you for breakfast.

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:51.540
W... What’s the matter with you, Ichigo?

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:53.200
D... Did something happen?

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:56.080
I can’t believe you’ve left food on your plate, Ichigo.

00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:58.700
You don’t have to act so surprised.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.290
W... W-We do!

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:04.550
Y... Y-You see, our main dish is grilled dried mackerel, your favorite!

00:01:04.550 --> 00:01:05.520
No thanks.

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:10.140
What’s wrong? Call the doctor.

00:01:10.140 --> 00:01:14.220
We’d better ask Abe-san on 3rd street to perform a purification ceremony.

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:17.650
How about asking the fortune teller on 4th street?

00:01:17.650 --> 00:01:21.280
I heard a prophet has just moved in on 5th street.

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:27.820
Does Aoyama-kun know?
It’s so disturbing I didn’t sleep well.

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:30.650
And now in the morning,
they’re threating me as if I was sick.

00:01:30.650 --> 00:01:32.830
I’m sure I’ll doze off during the class...

00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:35.050
Hi, Aoyama!

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:38.160
Morning!

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.440
Did you do your English homework?

00:01:41.440 --> 00:01:42.120
Yeah.

00:01:42.630 --> 00:01:44.860
Please, let me see your notebook.

00:01:44.860 --> 00:01:46.080
If you really need to...

00:01:55.520 --> 00:01:57.940
No, no, no, no, nooOO!

00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:02.520
Like this, I’m gloomy... too gloomy...

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:03.360
Oh, yes!

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:05.860
I camouflaged the fact so successfully when I was a Mew Mew.

00:02:05.860 --> 00:02:08.100
I suppose I can pretend that I know nothing about it!

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:10.370
That’s right, I will!

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:17.820
NYAAaaauuuuu!!

00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:20.460
Nya, nya, nya, nya...

00:02:20.460 --> 00:02:22.320
Nya, nya...

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.320
Momomiya-san?!

00:02:28.030 --> 00:02:28.660
Why?

00:02:29.720 --> 00:02:30.730
How come?

00:02:32.500 --> 00:02:35.010
Why must my most embarrassing situation...

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:38.850
...be seen by Aoyama-kun!?

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:43.600
That’s almost like broadcasting that I’m a cat!

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:48.700
Nyaaaaaaaa!

00:02:56.540 --> 00:02:57.910
What’s wrong, Aoyama?

00:02:57.910 --> 00:02:59.590
Nothing, I’m coming.

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:12.680
After all, I couldn’t say
anything to him.

00:03:12.680 --> 00:03:16.960
I just wanted to tell him, “Good luck in the next kendo tournament!”

00:03:17.810 --> 00:03:20.780
At this rate, I can’t even go and cheer for him.

00:03:24.520 --> 00:03:25.700
Heh...

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:28.150
Is that so?

00:03:28.150 --> 00:03:29.610
You love him so much?

00:03:29.610 --> 00:03:31.910
That feeble creature?

00:03:35.660 --> 00:03:37.690
Then, I have a plan.

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:41.760
Ichigo... I’ll have you know who you are!

00:03:54.720 --> 00:03:57.560
Isn’t there something strange about Ichigo?

00:03:57.560 --> 00:03:59.630
She has a gloomy aura!

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:01.730
What’s the matter with you?

00:04:01.730 --> 00:04:04.850
You usually have enough good health to spare.

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:06.440
No, nothing.

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:08.070
I have something good for you!

00:04:08.070 --> 00:04:09.310
This is for you!

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:12.820
Don’t make mischiefs like this!

00:04:12.820 --> 00:04:16.150
This is the smiler Yousei Gips.

00:04:18.750 --> 00:04:21.110
She’s even more depressed now.

00:04:23.580 --> 00:04:24.710
Ichigo-san?

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:30.550
Feel free to tell us your problem anytime.

00:04:30.550 --> 00:04:32.300
Don’t worry by yourself.

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:35.380
You know, we won’t be in shape when Ichigo is gloomy.

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:37.080
Cheer up!

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:40.840
I’m sorry to make you guys worry.

00:04:40.840 --> 00:04:42.810
But I’m fine.

00:04:42.810 --> 00:04:45.300
I’m just suffering from a lack of sleep.

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:00.650
Men!

00:05:00.650 --> 00:05:01.580
Dou!

00:05:02.480 --> 00:05:03.860
Dou ari!

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:08.220
Kyaa! Aoyama-kun has gained a point!

00:05:11.740 --> 00:05:12.300
Kote!

00:05:13.700 --> 00:05:14.870
Kote ari!

00:05:14.870 --> 00:05:18.330
Kyaa! Aoyama-kun won!

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:22.760
Kyaa! Aoyama-kun sat down!

00:05:24.340 --> 00:05:27.800
Kyaa! Aoyama-kun wiped off his sweat!

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:32.370
Kyaaaaa...! He looked at us!

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:44.500
What’s wrong?

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:46.500
You didn’t attack aggressively today.

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:48.700
Didn’t I?

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:51.330
What’s on your mind?

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:54.510
When your mind is unstable,
your sword is unstable...

00:05:54.510 --> 00:05:55.890
You can’t conceal it.

00:05:59.840 --> 00:06:03.250
I guess I don’t need to worry so much. I believe you.

00:06:03.810 --> 00:06:06.810
The tournament is this weekend. Calm your nerves.

00:06:06.810 --> 00:06:07.860
I will.

00:06:15.030 --> 00:06:17.870
Why... is she avoiding me?

00:06:20.450 --> 00:06:22.120
“Unstable mind”...?

00:06:37.670 --> 00:06:41.510
Ichigo-san has been drying the same table for thirty minutes.

00:06:41.510 --> 00:06:43.100
She’s been seriously shocked.

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:44.770
There’s no help for it.

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:49.340
Sorry. We’re closing
the shop for today...

00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:52.260
Hi!

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:53.560
Aoyama-san?!

00:06:55.530 --> 00:06:57.270
W-Why is he here?

00:06:58.400 --> 00:06:59.540
Umm...

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:01.480
Is Momomiya-san around?

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:09.210
Shh, no! I am not here!

00:07:09.210 --> 00:07:11.670
What? I can’t hear you.

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:13.500
Tell him I’m not here at the moment.

00:07:13.500 --> 00:07:16.850
SHE SAID SHE IS NOT HERE NOW!

00:07:23.180 --> 00:07:24.560
Anything wrong?

00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:29.310
I see...

00:07:29.310 --> 00:07:30.720
Well, it can’t be helped.

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:32.350
Erm...

00:07:32.350 --> 00:07:33.060
Well...

00:07:33.060 --> 00:07:34.680
I’m sorry to bother you.

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:36.320
Not at all...

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:38.200
Thanks. I’m leaving now.

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:43.740
Hey, what’s wrong?

00:07:43.740 --> 00:07:45.650
Cheer up!

00:07:48.410 --> 00:07:49.930
Aoyama-kun...

00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:55.260
The most destructive species in this world...

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:58.760
the humans are wasting
the Earth away.

00:08:01.350 --> 00:08:04.680
Feeble, wily, and ugly
human beings.

00:08:05.760 --> 00:08:07.100
Still...

00:08:08.810 --> 00:08:11.480
Why are you protecting
such creatures?

00:08:20.990 --> 00:08:22.850
Why are you...

00:08:28.240 --> 00:08:30.360
...falling for a mere human like him?

00:08:33.790 --> 00:08:34.960
Well, it’s okay.

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:38.090
He’ll die in any case.

00:08:47.750 --> 00:08:49.040
I’ve decided, Ichigo.

00:08:50.260 --> 00:08:53.350
With the lowest creature in this world...

00:08:53.350 --> 00:08:56.530
I will tear apart the person you love!

00:09:24.090 --> 00:09:27.540
Now... move as I order,
Chimera Anima!

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:37.510
You two will meet in order to say your final farewell!

00:09:38.150 --> 00:09:43.280
Ichigo... I will tear him limb from limb for you, while you watch.

00:10:03.610 --> 00:10:04.750
Alright!

00:10:09.410 --> 00:10:11.920
I haven’t gotten a chance to talk to him till today.

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:15.130
I just wanted to say
“Good luck!” to him.

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:18.680
When will the tournament begin?

00:10:24.030 --> 00:10:25.390
I can’t sit still!

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:31.310
I’ll cheer him from afar,
at the very least!

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:40.650
Kote!

00:10:40.650 --> 00:10:41.700
Kote ari!

00:10:47.070 --> 00:10:48.460
Aoyama-kun...

00:10:50.830 --> 00:10:53.830
<i>The trial heats in the men’s individual match are complete.</i>

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:57.180
<i>Next, the trial heats in the woman’s individual match will be held.</i>

00:10:57.840 --> 00:11:00.050
I can’t go after all.

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:06.020
Momomiya-san?

00:11:09.010 --> 00:11:10.560
Momomiya-san!

00:11:17.480 --> 00:11:18.650
Momomiya-san!

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:21.610
Aoyama-kun, how come...?

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:26.580
Momomiya-san, why are you running away?

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:29.540
Ichigo!

00:11:39.420 --> 00:11:40.840
Why did you leave?

00:11:43.130 --> 00:11:44.850
Why are you avoiding me?

00:11:45.840 --> 00:11:47.020
No...

00:11:48.110 --> 00:11:49.350
I...

00:11:53.720 --> 00:11:55.820
I have something to ask you.

00:11:57.490 --> 00:11:58.900
Momomiya-san, are you...

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:03.400
Aoyama-kun...

00:12:03.400 --> 00:12:03.870
Huh?

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:08.330
Win the tournament...
um, the final round.

00:12:09.040 --> 00:12:09.540
Ah...

00:12:09.990 --> 00:12:11.330
It’s show time!

00:12:16.790 --> 00:12:17.960
What’s this?

00:12:19.170 --> 00:12:20.440
Chimera Anima?

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:21.380
Aoyama-kun!

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:23.340
No! Don’t come!

00:12:25.210 --> 00:12:26.510
Aoyama-kun!

00:12:33.680 --> 00:12:34.980
Ichigo, run!

00:12:39.190 --> 00:12:40.440
What shall I do?

00:12:40.440 --> 00:12:43.200
I can’t do anything unless I transform.

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:47.950
But if I do, Aoyama-kun will know I’m a Mew Mew for sure this time.

00:12:48.400 --> 00:12:49.490
I don’t want that!

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:51.030
What are you waiting for?

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:52.330
Run away now!

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:54.500
Aoyama-kun!

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:58.330
Save yourself...!

00:12:58.330 --> 00:12:59.460
ICHIGO!

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:01.670
I can’t!

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:07.260
I can never run away and
leave him behind!

00:13:09.130 --> 00:13:11.090
I won’t mind even if he knows.

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:12.890
I will...

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:15.560
I will protect him!

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:20.400
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:13:58.520 --> 00:13:59.890
That’s enough!

00:13:59.890 --> 00:14:01.940
Ah! Aoyama-kun!

00:14:03.520 --> 00:14:04.400
Don’t worry!

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:06.400
He’s not dead yet.

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:08.230
You’re here at last.

00:14:08.230 --> 00:14:09.400
Quiche!

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:12.370
I’ve gotten tired of waiting... for this moment.

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:14.540
What do you mean?!

00:14:15.320 --> 00:14:19.200
I’ll tear him from limb-to-limb in front of you!

00:14:19.200 --> 00:14:19.830
Eh?!

00:14:19.830 --> 00:14:22.670
You can enjoy the sight of it...

00:14:22.670 --> 00:14:26.750
the sight of a feeble man dying a slow death.

00:14:26.750 --> 00:14:28.300
Who’d let you do such a thing!

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:32.600
StrawberBell!

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:36.100
Reborn Strawberry... CHECK!!

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:45.450
Aoyama-kun, are you okay?

00:14:51.570 --> 00:14:52.620
What’s this?

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:57.120
Even heard of “cell division”?

00:14:57.990 --> 00:15:00.710
I made some tricky changes on this Chimera Anima...

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:03.960
...so it won’t die even if
it’s cut up a little.

00:15:04.370 --> 00:15:08.920
Rather, it will multiply itself after being cut up.

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:17.850
Aoyama-kun!

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:24.610
STOP IT!!

00:15:25.730 --> 00:15:28.990
I can stop it... on one condition.

00:15:29.570 --> 00:15:30.820
What?

00:15:30.820 --> 00:15:32.410
What do you intend to do?

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:35.450
You know, I always say it:

00:15:37.320 --> 00:15:38.620
Be mine...

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:44.330
and I will spare him.

00:15:46.830 --> 00:15:48.220
NOOO!

00:15:48.870 --> 00:15:50.050
NO!

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:53.430
Aoyama-kun! Aoyama-kun!

00:15:55.010 --> 00:15:56.630
Aoyama-kun! Don’t die!

00:15:56.630 --> 00:15:57.480
Aoyama-kun!

00:16:07.770 --> 00:16:09.110
What’s this...?

00:16:09.110 --> 00:16:12.740
This warm power filling my body?

00:16:13.190 --> 00:16:13.950
What!?

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:23.370
What’s this power?

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:25.960
Don’t look down on me!

00:16:26.660 --> 00:16:28.380
I’m not yours.

00:16:29.670 --> 00:16:32.010
How dare you beat up Aoyama-kun like this!

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:36.350
I’ll never give in to
a bastard like you!

00:16:56.150 --> 00:16:59.750
Reborn Strawberry... CHECK!!

00:17:14.740 --> 00:17:16.680
I can’t believe...
such incredible power.

00:17:17.210 --> 00:17:19.390
Now it’s your turn, Quiche!

00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:24.440
If I fight against you now, you might really win.

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:27.350
But I won’t give you up.

00:17:27.930 --> 00:17:30.900
Sooner or later, you’ll be mine!

00:17:38.320 --> 00:17:39.860
Aoyama-kun...

00:17:39.860 --> 00:17:42.210
I’m relieved. You’re okay.

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:47.290
You know the truth this time around.

00:17:48.040 --> 00:17:49.160
Well, I don’t mind,

00:17:49.160 --> 00:17:51.380
because you’re safe, Aoyama-kun.

00:17:57.880 --> 00:17:58.590
See you!

00:17:59.080 --> 00:18:00.220
Wait up!

00:18:00.690 --> 00:18:03.140
I’m sorry... for the other day.

00:18:03.140 --> 00:18:07.060
You looked like someone I know, so I called you by her name...

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:08.310
Eh?

00:18:08.310 --> 00:18:10.230
What are you?

00:18:10.230 --> 00:18:12.190
He doesn’t know it’s me?

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:15.180
As I said before,

00:18:16.770 --> 00:18:18.360
I’m a Mew Mew.

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:20.410
The protector of justice that wanders by. ~Nya!

00:18:21.200 --> 00:18:22.370
W... Wait!

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:26.830
Ichigo?

00:18:27.200 --> 00:18:28.630
I’m in time...

00:18:31.120 --> 00:18:33.040
Congratulations on your championship victory!

00:18:33.040 --> 00:18:34.050
Thanks.

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:38.170
You were overwhelming!
The tournament finished so soon.

00:18:38.170 --> 00:18:41.510
Actually I wanted to see more of your fighting,

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:44.680
but, er, you were so cool.

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:46.220
Ichigo!

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:47.020
Yes?

00:18:47.560 --> 00:18:49.980
Thanks for coming to see
my tournament.

00:18:57.230 --> 00:18:59.950
Is he... by any chance...?

00:19:03.590 --> 00:19:04.580
Huh?

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:07.080
What’s this?

00:19:07.550 --> 00:19:10.170
I guess I have to put a bell
around you,

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:14.930
so you won’t run away any more.

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:17.550
Because you are my cat, Ichigo...

00:19:19.420 --> 00:19:20.510
...just kidding!

00:19:21.420 --> 00:19:22.600
Let’s go home.

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:23.890
Yeah!

00:19:30.010 --> 00:19:34.480
I’ll always wear his present, forever!

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:42.570
Quiche.

00:19:42.570 --> 00:19:44.450
I’m disappointed in you.

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:46.840
I’m terribly sorry, Deep Blue!

00:19:46.840 --> 00:19:47.950
But...!

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:49.620
Never mind...

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:52.840
I’ve already put another operation into action.

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:58.380
What are you doing there?

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:03.810
It’s so shameful that you’ve been beaten by Earthlings time and again!

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:07.760
Tart!

00:20:07.760 --> 00:20:08.310
Pie!

00:20:08.890 --> 00:20:10.510
Well, take it easy.

00:20:10.510 --> 00:20:15.310
Now that we’re here, it won’t take long to get rid of them.

00:20:25.110 --> 00:20:29.200
Once upon a time, there lived a beautiful woman and a man.

00:20:29.200 --> 00:20:31.410
They were happy lovers.

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:36.440
However, the man loved his research as much as his lover.

00:20:37.140 --> 00:20:43.550
One day, he was so absorbed in his research that he forgot their date for her birthday.

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:47.680
She left him so she would not disturb him in his study.

00:20:49.590 --> 00:20:50.710
Next episode:

00:20:50.710 --> 00:20:54.070
Akasaka’s Secret, Story of Pathetic Love
